# Fixes red/orange cast on skin from warm practical lights
# Targets H=354-30 degrees (red through orange), shifts to peach
# Also effective for red blotchy/flushed skin and skin conditions
# Only affects warm saturated tones - cool tones untouched
# Apply AFTER LogC to Rec.709 conversion
# Compatible with DaVinci Resolve and Adobe Premiere Pro
# Strength: 0.5
# Color model: linear-light tone (v2)
TITLE "Red Skin Fix - H354-30 Skin Only Hue to Peach"
LUT_3D_SIZE 33

